; heraldry (docs/ART.md 7): pennant, city banner, sigils. # field, % shade, * charge; the
; division (per pale, fess, bend, quarterly) is applied inside the `: flag` rectangle.

= ui/pennant 10x13 1,11
: flag 2,1,6,7
: note the stack pennant: a 6x8 swallow-tail on a pole, field and division only (no sigil)
.0000000..
06######0.
06######0.
06#####0..
06####0...
06#####0..
06######0.
06%%%%%%0.
06000000..
060.......
060.......
060.......
.0........

